Description: ViewOS desktop environment
 ViewOS is a Debian-based distribution whose desktop environment is
 selected by installing this metapackage.
 .
 It pulls in KDE Plasma 6, the Calamares installer, audio and network
 daemons, power management, graphics firmware for common Intel, AMD and
 Realtek devices, and a general-purpose set of applications.
 .
 The NVIDIA proprietary driver is deliberately not a hard dependency, so
 that this package remains installable on machines with no NVIDIA GPU.
 Install nvidia-driver on such machines to enable it.
